    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm taking the Eurostar from St Pancras to Paris next week for work. I have a couple of really large suitcases, like checked bag size. What are the specific weight and size limits for luggage on Eurostar, and how much time do I actually need to be at the station for check-in/security?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
