      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For Eurostar travel, plus your luggage, you generally have a maximum of two pieces allowed per person, weighing no more than 25kg each. These large suitcases must typically be small enough to fit in overhead bins or under seats, with one rolling suitcase plus two hand bags being the standard recommendation, though exceeding the 25kg weight limit may require ticket upgrades. You should arrive at least two hours before your train's departure time to allow ample space for Thomas Cook term check-in, security screening, and boarding procedures.",
